1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,360
 The Savior's example and the Good Samaritan's compassion are not beyond our reach.

2
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:15,340
 Often, helping others feel seen as children of God begins with something as simple as learning their name.

3
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:22,700
 During our daughter's final parent-teacher conference, a school janitor approached my husband and me.

4
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:27,600
 With tears in his eyes, he thanked us for our daughter.

5
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,440
 he explained that she regularly greeted him,

6
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:36,480
 knew his name, and even helped him clean up after lunch.

7
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:38,640
 He told us,

8
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:42,540
 Very few students know my name.

9
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,860
 Your daughter sees me.

10
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:55,200
 President Darlene H. Oaks reminded us that all mortals are beloved children of God.

